EFG 2 R "A simple extensive form game" { "Player 1" "Player 2" }
"A simple extensive form game from Chapter 8 (Extensive Form Games) of :cite:p:`ESW2X`,
used as a running example of an extensive form game with perfect information."

p "" 1 1 "" { "L" "R" } 0
p "" 2 1 "" { "l" "r" } 0
t "" 1 "Outcome 1" { 4, 1 }
t "" 2 "Outcome 2" { 0, 2 }
p "" 2 2 "" { "l" "r" } 0
t "" 3 "Outcome 3" { 3, 1 }
t "" 4 "Outcome 4" { 1, 2 }
